WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Bvisani mahatsi na zwimela zwi sa ṱoḓei kha tshitendeledzi tshine muri wa ḓo mela khatsho.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Gwani buranngo ḽo aṱamaho u fhira tshiṱumba tsha midzi, nga vhudzivha hatsho. Vheani mavu a nṱha thungo.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Ḓadzani buranngo nga maḓi. Arali maḓi a tshi kha ḓi vha hone matshelo, ṱavhani kha tshikwara.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Nṱha ha tshiṱumba tsha midzi hu lingane na mavu. Fhethu he muri wa ṱumelwa hone hu dzule nṱha ha mavu.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Tsikeledzani mavu nga vhulenda. Itani beseni ḽa u fara maḓi, ni vhee mulch kule na thanda.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:51.000
Sheledzani nga maḓi manzhi uri a swike kha midzi ya muri muswa.
